title: Start
---
<<declare $gold = 0>>
Ada: The merchant waits by the stall. #line:10a0001
-> Buy the map. <<if $gold >= 10>> #line:10o0001
    Ada: A fine choice. #line:10a0002
-> Haggle first. <<if $gold > 0 and $gold < 10>> #line:10o0002
    Ada: Numbers, then. #line:10a0003
-> Buy nothing. #line:10o0003
    <<stop>>
-> Leave quietly. #line:10o0004
Ada: The road continues either way. #line:10a0004
===
